```
const HOW_TO_SYNC =
  'If ' + CONTRACT + ' changed, commit the contract change first, then run "node scripts/sync-contract.mjs <git-ref>" from web/ with <git-ref> ' +
  'a commit that holds the new ' + CONTRACT + ' (the script reads the contract from a committed ref, so the sync takes two commits), ' +
