  'If the contract is unchanged (for example after a generator version bump), run "node scripts/sync-contract.mjs HEAD" from web/ ' +
  'and commit the files in web/src/api/generated/. ' +
  'If node_modules is missing, so the generator cannot be found, run "npm ci" in web/ first.';
```
